# Cloudflare Pages response headers (docs/0002-storage-byos.md decision 5).
# ponytail: no Content-Security-Policy yet. Next's static export uses inline
# scripts, so a CSP needs script hashes; add it with Google Drive OAuth.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
